   "description": "<div id=\"sparkled-assessment\"><div style=\"background:#2A0D0F; border-bottom:4px solid #E8B93E; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#E8B93E; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>MODULE INTRODUCTION</strong></div><div style=\"font-family:'Old Standard TT',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:26px; color:#FFFDF8; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:6px;\">Module Introduction: Stalin's Revolution</div><div style=\"font-size:15px; color:#E8B93E;\">Survey · 2 questions · not graded</div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; color:#E8B93E; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\">★ ─ ★ ─ ★</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:2px solid #9B1B1B; margin:0 0 16px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; border-top:4px solid #2A0D0F; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#2A0D0F; color:#FFFDF8; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Before you start</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 0;\">Welcome to Stalin’s Revolution. Answer the questions below before you open the first lesson. Your answers help your teacher see where the class is starting. This survey is not graded.</p></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; border-left:5px solid #9B1B1B; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 18px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9B1B1B; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>This module's goals:</strong></div><ul style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0; padding-left:26px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Explain why Lenin’s succession was left open and how Stalin used the post of General Secretary to win it.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Describe the aims and costs of the five-year plan, collectivization, and the Great Terror.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">Judg