 "discussions": [
  {
   "title": "16.8 Discussion: Was Stalin Lenin's heir or his betrayer?",
   "html": "<div id=\"sparkled-assessment\"><div style=\"background:#2A0D0F; border-bottom:4px solid #E8B93E; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#E8B93E; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>DISCUSSION</strong></div><div style=\"font-family:'Old Standard TT',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:26px; color:#FFFDF8; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:6px;\">Was Stalin Lenin’s heir or his betrayer?</div><div style=\"font-size:16px; color:#F0DDD9; margin-bottom:6px;\">Did Stalin carry Lenin's work forward, or turn against it?</div><div style=\"font-size:15px; color:#E8B93E;\">Graded discussion · 10 points · one post and one reply</div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center; color:#E8B93E; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 4px;\">★ ─ ★ ─ ★</div>\n<div style=\"border-top:2px solid #9B1B1B; margin:0 0 16px;\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; border-left:5px solid #9B1B1B; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 18px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px; color:#9B1B1B; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>HOW TO WORK</strong></div><div style=\"font-size:16px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.55;\">Read the two lessons and the two primary sources first, and look over your notes in My Notebook. Then post your answer to the prompt below, and reply to one classmate.</div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; border-top:4px solid #2A0D0F; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#2A0D0F; color:#FFFDF8; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>DISCUSSION PROMPT</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 12px;\">This week’s question: Was Stalin Lenin’s heir or his betrayer?</p><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 12px;\">Choose a side. Name one thing Lenin had already begun before 1924 that Stalin later used, and one thing Stalin did that Lenin never did. Explain how each one supports your side.</p><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 12px;\">Write 150 to 250 words. State one claim you believe is true. Then explain why, using the specific evidence named above. Keep to what the lessons and the sources show. If you are guessing, say so.</p><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 0;\">Then add one sentence on honesty. What happens to a country when its people cannot say true things about their leaders? Use an example from the lessons or sources if you can.</p></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; border-top:4px solid #4A4A48; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#4A4A48; color:#FFFDF8; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>RESPOND TO A CLASSMATE</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 0;\">Reply to one classmate. Do you agree with their reasoning? If so, strengthen it with a fact or decision they did not use. If not, say politely where you think it falls short, and give your reason.</p></div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; border-top:4px solid #9B1B1B; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#9B1B1B; color:#FFFDF8; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>GRADING RUBRIC (10 pts)</strong></div><table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\"><thead><tr style=\"background:#2A0D0F;\"><th style=\"padding:9px 12px; font-size:13px; color:#FFFDF8; text-align:left; border:1px solid #DDD2CC;\"></th></tr><tr style=\"background: #0E1C42;\">\n            <th style=\"padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #fff; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #334;\">Criteria</th><th style=\"padding:9px 12px; font-size:13px; color:#FFFDF8; text-align:left; border:1px solid #DDD2CC;\">Substantive (full credit)</th><th style=\"padding:9px 12px; font-size:13px; color:#FFFDF8; text-align:left; border:1px solid #DDD2CC;\">Thin (partial credit)</th><th style=\"padding:9px 12px; font-size:13px; color:#FFFDF8; text-align:left; border:1px solid #DDD2CC;\">Missing (no credit)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"background:#FFFDF8;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#2A0D0F; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; width:150px; vertical-align:top;\">Your claim and your reasons<br><span style=\"font-size:12px; color:#9B1B1B;\">6 pts</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#1C1B1A; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; vertical-align:top;\">Takes a clear side, uses the specific evidence the prompt asks for, and explains why it supports the claim.</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#1C1B1A; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; vertical-align:top;\">Takes a side but gives general reasons, or leaves out part of what the prompt asks for.</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#1C1B1A; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; vertical-align:top;\">No post, or no claim.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#F6F0EB;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#2A0D0F; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; width:150px; vertical-align:top;\">Your reply to a classmate<br><span style=\"font-size:12px; color:#9B1B1B;\">4 pts</span></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#1C1B1A; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; vertical-align:top;\">Answers one classmate's actual reasoning. Strengthens it or says where it falls short, politely and with a reason.</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#1C1B1A; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; vertical-align:top;\">Replies, but only to agree or disagree with no reason.</td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; color:#1C1B1A; border:1px solid #DDD2CC; vertical-align:top;\">No reply.</td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"text-align:right; margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; color:#9B1B1B;\">10 pts total</div></div>\n</div>",
